{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build To Satisfy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create brilliant musical patterns and chaotic points machines in this unique physics-based idle-progression game. Unlock and deploy dozens of unique bumpers, cannons, flippers, explosives and more that have you scoring exponentially more points with every addition to your simulation.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/Animation2.gif?t=1741924045\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Simulate To Your Own Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design the pinball machine of your dreams with balls flooding everywhere or a precision Rube-Goldberg machine that collects every coin in a stage. As long as the balls keep moving the points (<i>and music</i>) will flow.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/Animation.gif?t=1741924045\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>I didn't know you were a chill game like that.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through four stages with unique mechanics and music while unlocking over 250 achievements. Once you've seen the stages, <u><i>Ascend</i></u><i>\u00a0</i>your progression by spending achievement points to make your next run faster, and allowing you to complete even greater challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412790/extras/Animation3.gif?t=1741924045\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bongo Starter Pack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412790/bc551280d1e94c96c4aedf4337f016716885c8cb.jpg"},{"name":"Bongo Enjoyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412790/18701b9e63a8c8be926a377967f46c3124d01458.jpg"},{"